are you thoughts here? Does it look OK? \r\n\r\nHad to add a `secret` property in PasswordTokenGenerator to handle lazy reading the secret value from SECRET_KEYS. \r\n\r\nDo you think it's viable. Happy to work it if so. \r\nClearly it needs docs. \r\nWhat test do you want to see? \r\n\r\nThanks! 🚀 \r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/13850/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/13850/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/13618","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/13618/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/13618/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/13618/events","html_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/13618","id":730742382,"node_id":"MDExOlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0NTEwOTk2NzUw","number":13618,"title":"Fixed 30360 -- Support rotation of secret keys.","user":{"login":"terrameijar","id":3416132,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTYxMzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3416132?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/terrameijar","html_url":"https://github.com/terrameijar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/terrameijar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/terrameijar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/terrameijar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/terrameijar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/terrameijar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/terrameijar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/terrameijar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users